%% 图 04：轮询团队状态图
%% 中文注释：TERMINATE 是业务层正常结束；max_turns 是系统层安全兜底。
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initializing: 启动程序
    state "初始化：读取配置并创建团队" as Initializing
    state "产品经理回合：分析需求" as ProductManagerTurn
    state "工程师回合：提出实现" as EngineerTurn
    state "审查员回合：检查代码" as CodeReviewerTurn
    state "用户代理回合：人工验收" as UserProxyTurn
    state "配置错误：参数或密钥无效" as ConfigurationError
    state "业务终止：检测到 TERMINATE" as Terminated
    state "安全终止：达到 max_turns" as TurnLimitReached
    state "资源释放：关闭模型客户端" as ClosingClient
    state "完成：返回结果摘要" as Completed

    Initializing --> ProductManagerTurn: 初始化成功
    Initializing --> ConfigurationError: 初始化失败
    ConfigurationError --> [*]
    ProductManagerTurn --> EngineerTurn: 固定轮询
    EngineerTurn --> CodeReviewerTurn: 固定轮询
    CodeReviewerTurn --> UserProxyTurn: 固定轮询
    UserProxyTurn --> Terminated: 输入 TERMINATE
    UserProxyTurn --> ProductManagerTurn: 输入修改意见
    ProductManagerTurn --> TurnLimitReached: 达到轮数上限
    EngineerTurn --> TurnLimitReached: 达到轮数上限
    CodeReviewerTurn --> TurnLimitReached: 达到轮数上限
    UserProxyTurn --> TurnLimitReached: 达到轮数上限
    Terminated --> ClosingClient
    TurnLimitReached --> ClosingClient
    ClosingClient --> Completed
    Completed --> [*]

    note right of Terminated
      正常完成路径：用户明确确认验收完成
    end note
    note right of TurnLimitReached
      保护路径：避免 Agent 对话无限循环
    end note

